<view class="companion-page" style="padding-top:{{topInset}}px"
  ><view class="companion-header"
    ><button bindtap="back" aria-label="返回伙伴小屋">
      <t-icon name="chevron-left" size="25px" /></button
    ><text>伙伴收藏室</text
    ><text class="companion-header__wallet"
      >✦ {{state.crystals || 0}} · ✧ {{state.shards || 0}}</text
    ></view
  ><view class="companion-tabs"
    ><button
      aria-label="我的仓库{{mode === 'inventory' ? '，已选择' : ''}}"
      class="{{mode==='inventory'?'active':''}}"
      data-mode="inventory"
      bindtap="changeMode"
    >
      我的仓库</button
    ><button
      aria-label="光点小铺{{mode === 'shop' ? '，已选择' : ''}}"
      class="{{mode==='shop'?'active':''}}"
      data-mode="shop"
      bindtap="changeMode"
    >
      光点小铺
    </button></view
  ><view class="companion-tabs"
    ><button class="{{tab==='skins'?'active':''}}" data-tab="skins" bindtap="changeTab">
      伙伴形象</button
    ><button class="{{tab==='accessories'?'active':''}}" data-tab="accessories" bindtap="changeTab">
      随身装饰</button
    ><button class="{{tab==='furniture'?'active':''}}" data-tab="furniture" bindtap="changeTab">
      小院家具
    </button></view
  >
  <view wx:if="{{tab==='skins'}}" class="companion-card"
    ><image class="collection-hero" src="{{heroSrc}}" mode="aspectFit" /><text
      class="companion-title"
      >在校园里，遇见八位搭子</text
    ><text class="companion-muted"
      >每位伙伴都有自己的小性格，获得概率均为 12.5%。每次 100 光点；重复形象返还 20 光点和 5
      星屑。</text
    ><button
      class="companion-primary"
      disabled="{{busy || !state.adoptedAt || state.crystals<100}}"
      loading="{{busy}}"
      bindtap="drawSkin"
    >
      ✦ 100 · 抽取伙伴形象
    </button></view
  >
  <text wx:if="{{actionMessage}}" class="companion-message">{{actionMessage}}</text
  ><text class="companion-muted"
    >{{tab==='furniture'?'把山大的银杏、书香与校园印记，一点点装进小家。':tab==='accessories'?'小小装饰，让今天的相遇多一点不同。':'每一种模样，都陪你认真收藏普通的日子。'}}</text
  ><view wx:if="{{isLoading}}" class="companion-empty">正在打开仓库…</view
  ><view class="companion-grid"
    ><view
      wx:for="{{items}}"
      wx:key="id"
      class="companion-item {{item.selected?'companion-item--selected':''}}"
      ><view
        wx:if="{{item.previewCropped}}"
        class="companion-sprite-preview"
        style="{{item.previewStyle}}"
      ></view
      ><image
        wx:elif="{{item.src}}"
        src="{{item.src}}"
        mode="aspectFit"
        lazy-load="{{true}}"
      /><view
        wx:else
        class="companion-placeholder {{tab==='skins'?'companion-placeholder--pet':''}}"
        style="background:{{item.color}}44"
        >轻装出门</view
      ><text class="companion-item__name">{{item.name}}</text
      ><text wx:if="{{item.newArrival}}" class="companion-new-arrival">新到 · 第二批</text
      ><text wx:if="{{item.role}}" class="companion-item__role">{{item.role}}</text
      ><text class="companion-item__note">{{item.statusLabel}}</text
      ><text class="companion-item__description">{{item.description}}</text>
      <button
        wx:if="{{tab==='skins'}}"
        class="companion-secondary"
        data-id="{{item.id}}"
        disabled="{{busy || !item.owned || item.selected || !state.adoptedAt}}"
        bindtap="actOnItem"
      >
        {{item.selected?'使用中':item.owned?'换上':'等待遇见'}}
      </button>
      <button
        wx:elif="{{tab==='accessories'}}"
        class="companion-secondary"
        data-id="{{item.id}}"
        disabled="{{busy || item.selected || !state.adoptedAt}}"
        bindtap="actOnItem"
      >
        {{item.selected?'使用中':item.owned?'换上':'✧ '+item.price+' 兑换'}}
      </button>
      <button
        wx:elif="{{mode==='shop'}}"
        class="companion-secondary"
        data-id="{{item.id}}"
        disabled="{{busy || !state.adoptedAt || state.crystals<item.price}}"
        bindtap="actOnItem"
      >
        ✦ {{item.price}} 兑换
      </button>
      <button
        wx:else
        class="companion-secondary"
        data-id="{{item.id}}"
        disabled="{{busy || !state.adoptedAt || item.available<1}}"
        bindtap="actOnItem"
      >
        {{item.available>0?'摆到小院':'已全部摆出'}}
      </button>
    </view></view
  >
  <view wx:if="{{tab==='furniture'}}" class="scene-ideas">
    <text class="companion-title">搭配灵感</text>
    <view wx:for="{{sceneIdeas}}" wx:key="id" class="companion-card">
      <image class="scene-idea-image" src="{{item.src}}" mode="widthFix" lazy-load="{{true}}" />
      <text class="companion-title">{{item.name}}</text
      ><text class="companion-muted">{{item.note}}</text>
    </view>
  </view>
  <view wx:if="{{rewardName}}" class="collection-reveal" bindtap="closeReward">
    <view class="companion-card"
      ><text class="companion-kicker">把今天的小惊喜收进口袋</text
      ><image src="{{rewardSrc}}" mode="aspectFit" /><text class="companion-title"
        >你好，{{rewardName}}</text
      ><text class="companion-muted">{{actionMessage}}</text
      ><button class="companion-primary" bindtap="closeReward">收好这份相遇</button></view
    >
  </view>
</view>
